# The directory below is written in by the spec at build time from the one place it is defined, so
# that moving the application cannot leave this rule naming a path nothing is installed to — a
# stale rule installs and loads without complaint and then does nothing at all.
#
# The launcher alone. The rest of the directory is assemblies and web assets that are read and
# never executed, and lib_t is the right label for those.
@APPDIR@/HostPinger		--	gen_context(system_u:object_r:bin_t,s0)
